WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.332
Sid and Sara ran.

2
00:00:12.333 --> 00:00:14.703
Bees flew after them.

3
00:00:14.704 --> 00:00:20.250
Buzz! Buzz!

4
00:00:20.251 --> 00:00:24.184
"This way, Sid!" Sara yelled.

5
00:00:24.185 --> 00:00:31.613
She and Sid ran up the hill.

6
00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:41.800
"The bees followed us!" Sid said.

7
00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:48.828
Tor saw Sid and Sara running.

8
00:00:48.829 --> 00:00:51.090
Tor saw the bees.

9
00:00:51.091 --> 00:00:53.204
"Uh-oh," Tor thought.

10
00:00:53.205 --> 00:00:59.011
"Sid and Sara are in trouble!"

11
00:00:59.012 --> 00:01:01.398
Tor flew down.

12
00:01:01.399 --> 00:01:04.801
"Sara, Sid!" Tor said.

13
00:01:04.802 --> 00:01:17.041
"Follow me!"

14
00:01:17.042 --> 00:01:21.292
Tor flew to the pond.

15
00:01:21.293 --> 00:01:24.253
Sid and Sara followed Tor.

16
00:01:24.254 --> 00:01:29.430
The bees followed Sid and Sara.

17
00:01:29.431 --> 00:01:33.227
"Jump into the pond!" Tor said.

18
00:01:33.228 --> 00:01:37.906
Sid and Sara jumped. Splash!

19
00:01:37.907 --> 00:01:43.355
They hid under the water.

20
00:01:43.356 --> 00:01:49.867
The bees left.

21
00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:52.410
Rex ran over.

22
00:01:52.411 --> 00:01:55.454
"I found you, Tor!" he said.

23
00:01:55.455 --> 00:01:58.171
Tor sighed.

24
00:01:58.172 --> 00:02:01.021
Sara popped her head up.

25
00:02:01.022 --> 00:02:05.175
"I found you, Sara!" Rex said.

26
00:02:05.176 --> 00:02:21.548
"Hmph!" Sara said.

27
00:02:21.549 --> 00:02:23.808
Sid popped up too.

28
00:02:23.809 --> 00:02:29.851
"I won, Rex!" he cried.

29
00:02:29.852 --> 00:02:39.643
"Hide-and-seek is fun!"

